# Advantech ADAM-6060.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Advantech ADAM-6060 — 6DI / 6-Relay Output Module with Counter/Pulse (Ethernet/Modbus TCP)
# | 
# | Source: advantech-adam-6000-modbus.pdf (Appendix B.2)
# | - 6 digital inputs (DI) + 6 relay outputs (DO); each DI configurable as counter/frequency.
# | - ADAM-6060 and ADAM-6066 share the same register map; 6066 has higher-capacity power relays.
# | - Modbus TCP (Ethernet), unit identifier = 1.
# | - FC02 addr 0-5 (00001-00006): DI value ch 0-5 (R).
# | - FC01 addr 16-21 (00017-00022): DO relay value ch 0-5 (R/W).
# | - FC01 counter coils per DI ch (4 coils each):
# | ch 0: addr 32-35 (start/stop, clear, clear-overflow, latch); ... ch 5: addr 52-55.
# | - FC01 addr 300-307 (00301-00308): Clear GCL internal counter ch 0-7 (Write).
# | - FC03 addr 0-11: Counter/Frequency ch 0-5 (u32, 2 regs each; Freq = value/10 Hz) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 12-23: Pulse output low-level width ch 0-5 (u32, unit 0.1ms) (R/W).
# | - FC03 addr 24-35: Pulse output high-level width ch 0-5 (u32) (R/W).
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Advantech
@model=ADAM-6060
@description=6DI + 6-relay output with counter/frequency and pulse output over Modbus TCP. DI at FC02 coil addr 0-5; relay DO at FC01 coil addr 16-21. FC03 addr 0-11: counter/freq u32 (6ch). FC03 addr 300: DI word; addr 302: DO word. Same register map as ADAM-6066.
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/advantech-adam-6060-relay.toml; Source: advantech-adam-6000-modbus.pdf (Appendix B.2). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
